# Environment file for pilothoused.service — the privileged broker.
#
# The unit references this file as `EnvironmentFile=-/etc/pilothouse/pilothoused.env`,
# so it is optional and every line below is deliberately commented out:
# installing the package changes no runtime behavior. Uncomment and edit a
# line to override a default.
#
# Backup timers to monitor, comma separated. Backups are never inferred from
# unit names, so the broker reports only the systemd timer units named here.
# The value is merged with any --backup-timer flag the unit's ExecStart
# passes; the flag is repeatable and this variable is its comma-separated
# equivalent.
#
#PILOTHOUSE_BACKUP_TIMERS=restic.timer,borg.timer
